SSAL Binder probe uses Android Open Source Project platform headers.

Android libbinder and libutils headers:
Copyright (C) 2005-2025 The Android Open Source Project

The header source dependencies are obtained from the official Android
repositories at the android-16.0.0_r2 tag. Original copyright and Apache
License 2.0 notices are retained in the downloaded headers. See the
accompanying LICENSE.binder-probe for the Apache License 2.0 text.

The platform shared libraries used for linking are read from the user's
guest image and are NOT redistributed in the SSAL module. At runtime the
probe uses that guest image's libraries; their hashes are checked before
the probe is executed.
